[{"name":"UgonnaCO/Drive-Wiping-Utility-with-PowerShell","owner":"UgonnaCO","html_url":"https://github.com/UgonnaCO/Drive-Wiping-Utility-with-PowerShell","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"This project features a PowerShell script that guides users through securely wiping any connected drives. Users can select the target disk and customize the number of passes for data erasure. The script automatically configures and runs a diskpart script to perform the sanitization, ensuring data is thoroughly and securely erased.","topics":[],"score":180011,"global_rank":404419},{"name":"UgonnaCO/Secure-Cloud-Migration-and-Compliance","owner":"UgonnaCO","html_url":"https://github.com/UgonnaCO/Secure-Cloud-Migration-and-Compliance","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Implementation of a cloud security solution for SWBTL LLC using Microsoft Azure. This project focuses on enhancing security posture, ensuring regulatory compliance, and migrating critical business functions to a secure cloud environment. Key areas include access control, data encryption, role-based access management, and backup strategies.","topics":[],"score":180011,"global_rank":404420},{"name":"pfa230/teloxide-serverless","owner":"pfa230","html_url":"https://github.com/pfa230/teloxide-serverless","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180011,"global_rank":404421},{"name":"haochenmiao/health_Agency_cost","owner":"haochenmiao","html_url":"https://github.com/haochenmiao/health_Agency_cost","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180011,"global_rank":404422},{"name":"ashishakonnur/Financial-Analysis-Final-Project-on-Visa-Inc","owner":"ashishakonnur","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishakonnur/Financial-Analysis-Final-Project-on-Visa-Inc","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Detailed Analysis on Visa Inc. operations, Financial Statement and Stock Value. And be able to make projections of the company's Net Income for next 3-years and market capital.","topics":[],"score":180009,"global_rank":404423},{"name":"ashishakonnur/Kickstarter-Project---Tableau-KNIME-Workflow","owner":"ashishakonnur","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishakonnur/Kickstarter-Project---Tableau-KNIME-Workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"With this Kickstarter project, our group is trying to build a more nuanced predictive model on what crowdfunding campaigns may succeed, and to what degree they will succeed. Since Kickstarter only makes money once a project has passed its goal \u2013 and has been deemed a success \u2013 it is already in their best interests to only have successful campaigns. But if there were a way to determine which campaigns would be extremely successful \u2013 and could theoretically be even more successful with the right publicity on their end \u2013 Kickstarter would find this information extremely valuable. We could also provide a service to a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":180009,"global_rank":404424},{"name":"JY1148/others","owner":"JY1148","html_url":"https://github.com/JY1148/others","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Python Django Online Course System (v1.0)","topics":[],"score":180009,"global_rank":404425},{"name":"hmorzaria/sdmcourse","owner":"hmorzaria","html_url":"https://github.com/hmorzaria/sdmcourse","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"SDM course World Fishery Congress","topics":[],"score":180009,"global_rank":404426},{"name":"MatthewStoneMBA/Lander-Leash-Analytics-Project","owner":"MatthewStoneMBA","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthewStoneMBA/Lander-Leash